{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_011", "name": "芦苇海", "valley": "树正沟", "category": "沼泽化湖泊", "description": "海拔 2192 米的半沼泽湖泊。芦苇海东侧对面石灰岩崖壁上，因岩石自然风化痕迹和植物装饰作用，形成一幅端庄秀丽的少女脸庞，传说是九寨沟的沃洛瑟嫫女神。", "highlights": "半沼泽湖泊、女神岩壁", "elevation_meters": 2192, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 15, "visit_duration_source": "estimated", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.23, "longitude": 103.921, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "请沿指定栈道游览，请勿离开栈道；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与游泳、禁止投喂野生动物，请勿携带宠物入园。", "notice_extra": "官方口径：芦苇海可步行游览或乘车观赏。", "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_012", "name": "盆景滩", "valley": "树正沟", "category": "滩流", "description": "长 218 米、宽 98 米、水深 0.8 米，是进入九寨沟的第一个滩流景观。浅滩上柳、柏、杨、松、杜鹃等植物丛生，树干四周因钙华堆积形成略高于水面的天然盆堤，宛若一组组盆景。", "highlights": "钙华天然盆景、入沟第一景", "elevation_meters": 2190, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 10, "visit_duration_source": "third_party", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "亲子家庭", "老年游客"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.238, "longitude": 103.92, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "请沿指定栈道游览，请勿离开栈道；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与游泳、禁止投喂野生动物，请勿携带宠物入园。", "notice_extra": null, "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05", "src_24"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_013", "name": "荷叶寨", "valley": "树正沟", "category": "藏寨人文", "description": "景区内现存三个藏族村寨之一（另两个为树正寨、则查洼寨），位于沟口至盆景滩之间；附近设有荷叶停车场，距景区约 100 米。官方未公布其海拔与详细描述。", "highlights": "现存三寨之一、藏式民居、紧邻沟口", "elevation_meters": null, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": null, "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 20, "visit_duration_source": "estimated", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.248, "longitude": 103.92, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "请沿指定栈道游览，请勿离开栈道；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与游泳、禁止投喂野生动物，请勿携带宠物入园。", "notice_extra": null, "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_014", "name": "诺日朗瀑布", "valley": "日则沟", "category": "瀑布", "description": "高 24.5 米、宽 320 米，是中国最宽的高山钙华瀑布。滔滔流水自诺日朗群海而来，从瀑顶树丛中倾泻而下，像数条洁白的哈达，水势浩大、声震山谷；寒冬时节瀑布成巨大冰幔，无数冰柱悬挂陡崖，是九寨沟六绝之一「蓝冰」的代表。位于 Y 形三沟交汇处，紧邻诺日朗中心站。", "highlights": "中国最宽钙华瀑布、冬季蓝冰冰幔、紧邻诺日朗中心站", "elevation_meters": 2343, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 40, "visit_duration_source": "third_party", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者", "亲子家庭"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.192, "longitude": 103.897, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "请沿指定栈道游览，请勿离开栈道；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与游泳、禁止投喂野生动物，请勿携带宠物入园。", "notice_extra": "官方一日游线路安排在诺日朗中心站午餐时段（11:30—13:30）观赏诺日朗瀑布。", "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05", "src_24"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_015", "name": "诺日朗群海", "valley": "日则沟", "category": "湖泊群", "description": "由大小 20 个钙华湖泊组成，紧密相间分布，连绵四百余米；最大海子长 185 米、宽 45 米，最小长仅 20 米、宽 15 米，水深多在 7—20 米、最深达 23 米，发育钙华溶蚀现象，成因类似边石坝、彩池。", "highlights": "边石坝式钙华彩池群、连绵四百余米", "elevation_meters": 2353, "elevation_note": "2353—2365 米", "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 10, "visit_duration_source": "third_party", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.194, "longitude": 103.897, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "请沿指定栈道游览，请勿离开栈道；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与游泳、禁止投喂野生动物，请勿携带宠物入园。", "notice_extra": null, "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05", "src_24"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_016", "name": "镜海", "valley": "日则沟", "category": "湖泊/海子", "description": "长 1155 米、宽 241 米、深 31 米，是九寨沟第三大湖泊，因水面平静如镜而得名。每当晨曦初现，蓝天白云、远山飞鸟都尽收海底，清晰可见，倒影胜实景。", "highlights": "晨间倒影、景区第三大湖", "elevation_meters": 2367, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 10, "visit_duration_source": "third_party", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.19, "longitude": 103.895, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "栈道台阶较多、雨后湿滑，请穿防滑鞋并扶好栏杆，请勿在栈道追逐打闹；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与投喂野生动物。", "notice_extra": "官方口径：清晨是观赏镜海倒影的最佳时段；镜海停车场至诺日朗瀑布公路对面栈道在季节性轮休保育期间关闭。", "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05", "src_24"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_017", "name": "珍珠滩", "valley": "日则沟", "category": "滩流", "description": "滩面宽 112.3 米、长 189 米，平均坡度 20 度，相对高差 15 米，是九寨沟最宽阔的滩面，为碳酸钙沉积而成的大型钙华堆积台地。阳光下湍流在凹凸不平的滩面宣泄而下，溅起无数水珠宛如粒粒洁白珍珠。", "highlights": "最宽阔钙华滩面、珍珠飞溅", "elevation_meters": 2450, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 30, "visit_duration_source": "estimated", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者", "亲子家庭"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.186, "longitude": 103.892, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "请沿指定栈道游览，请勿离开栈道；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与游泳、禁止投喂野生动物，请勿携带宠物入园。", "notice_extra": null, "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05"]}
{"park_id": "jiuzhaigou_scenic_area", "data_source": "official", "created_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "attraction_id": "attr_018", "name": "珍珠滩瀑布", "valley": "日则沟", "category": "瀑布", "description": "均高 21 米、瀑宽 270 米。由第四纪冰川遗存的冰碛台地再经钙化作用，使瀑布坡坎更加高耸坚固，瀑面后凹呈新月型。瀑布跌落谷底发出震耳欲聋的水声，气势磅礡；此处负氧离子含量极为丰富，有「天然氧吧」之称。", "highlights": "新月型瀑面、天然氧吧", "elevation_meters": 2433, "elevation_note": null, "elevation_source": "official", "opening_hours": "旺季 08:00-18:00（08:00-14:00 入园）；淡季 08:30-18:00（08:30-14:00 入园）", "opening_hours_source": "park_level", "ticket_price": 0, "ticket_note": "九寨沟景点不单独售票，含于景区门票（旺季 190 元 / 淡季 80 元）。", "visit_duration_minutes": 30, "visit_duration_source": "estimated", "difficulty": "轻松", "difficulty_source": "derived", "suitable_for": ["普通游客", "摄影爱好者"], "suitable_for_source": "derived", "latitude": 33.184, "longitude": 103.892, "coordinate_source": "estimated", "in_standard_tour": true, "seasonal_closure": null, "notice": "栈道台阶较多、雨后湿滑，请穿防滑鞋并扶好栏杆，请勿在栈道追逐打闹；景区内严禁吸烟、禁止下滩踩水与投喂野生动物。", "notice_extra": "孔雀河道至珍珠滩面公路对面栈道在季节性轮休保育期间关闭。", "status": "open", "updated_at": "2026-09-30T00:00:00+00:00", "source_ids": ["src_02", "src_05"]}
